{"txn": 43, "events": [{"seq": 69, "kind": "package_stored", "payload": {"package_id": "dep-6b90fdcae2", "item_id": "wi-10c36ccffd", "content_hash": "6fd091b9003bda625d159b1f0ae1e2f33372182cff9b9fbbe9e3a60fb9329820", "content_preview": "## 简报：本周用户反馈要点\n\n1. **更新后手机负担明显增加**：不少用户反映应用会闪退，机身发热、耗电也变快；虽然闪退有好转，但仍影响日常使用。  \n2. **阅读舒适度不足**：夜间模式偏暗、切换时间不准，另有用户希望字体可以调大。  \n3. **客服支持跟不上**：工单回复慢、自动回复常答非所问，转人工也较难，用户感到响应比之前更慢。\n\n### 优先级建议\n建议本周优先处理“更新后闪退、", "source_refs": [], "size": 237, "artifact_ref": "6fd091b9003bda625d159b1f0ae1e2f33372182cff9b9fbbe9e3a60fb9329820.txt", "stage": "submission", "submission_id": "submission-926b82480b", "node_id": "node-0d5c3886e9", "attempt": 1, "context_epoch": 0, "session_id": "sess-da22d650c2"}, "ts": 1789095032.081887}, {"seq": 70, "kind": "work_item_submitted", "payload": {"item_id": "wi-10c36ccffd", "submission_id": "submission-926b82480b", "node_id": "node-0d5c3886e9", "attempt": 1, "context_epoch": 0, "session_id": "sess-da22d650c2", "output_sha256": "6fd091b9003bda625d159b1f0ae1e2f33372182cff9b9fbbe9e3a60fb9329820", "package_id": "dep-6b90fdcae2"}, "ts": 1789095032.082229}]}
