{"txn": 58, "events": [{"seq": 90, "kind": "package_stored", "payload": {"package_id": "dep-e9f0681d87", "item_id": "wi-7c0a3de685", "content_hash": "6ac3f44030c58120779d01d48748e753715d04d661a7ce299b5b7c4e9429b365", "content_preview": "# 反馈分析（子任务 A）\n\n1. **更新后稳定性问题突出**：闪退高频发生，且集中在打开聊天记录场景，最新补丁后有所缓解。（证据：1、5）\n2. **电池与发热体验恶化**：待机耗电异常加快、健康度显示不准，部分用户反馈发热严重，疑似与本次更新相关。（证据：4、8）\n3. **客服响应能力不足**：工单积压无人处理、机器人答非所问、整体响应速度较上月明显下降。（证据：3、12）\n\n（备注：夜间", "source_refs": [], "size": 304, "artifact_ref": "6ac3f44030c58120779d01d48748e753715d04d661a7ce299b5b7c4e9429b365.txt", "stage": "submission", "submission_id": "submission-9fcaec2029", "node_id": "node-926ba5a9c2", "attempt": 1, "context_epoch": 0, "session_id": "sess-d9e944c59e"}, "ts": 1789095489.8443468}, {"seq": 91, "kind": "work_item_submitted", "payload": {"item_id": "wi-7c0a3de685", "submission_id": "submission-9fcaec2029", "node_id": "node-926ba5a9c2", "attempt": 1, "context_epoch": 0, "session_id": "sess-d9e944c59e", "output_sha256": "6ac3f44030c58120779d01d48748e753715d04d661a7ce299b5b7c4e9429b365", "package_id": "dep-e9f0681d87"}, "ts": 1789095489.844986}]}
