{"txn": 66, "events": [{"seq": 104, "kind": "package_stored", "payload": {"package_id": "dep-3e4fcc9904", "item_id": "wi-ed2210e0c8", "content_hash": "1ff9dbc5ded0aa5e099805173e75d3067c4c14fc1947c554e514d4670c1c372a", "content_preview": "# 用户反馈管理层简报\n\n**背景**：我们汇总了最近一周 12 条用户反馈，归纳出三类核心问题，现汇报如下。\n\n**一、新版本稳定性问题（最突出）**\n更新后出现闪退、发热、耗电加快等问题，用户日常使用受影响明显（证据：反馈 1、4）。好消息是最新补丁后闪退已有所缓解（反馈 10），说明修复方向正确，但仍需巩固。\n\n**二、界面体验与无障碍问题（影响特定人群）**\n夜间模式存在看不清、自动切换时", "source_refs": [], "size": 507, "artifact_ref": "1ff9dbc5ded0aa5e099805173e75d3067c4c14fc1947c554e514d4670c1c372a.txt", "stage": "submission", "submission_id": "submission-919b050bf6", "node_id": "node-d55f84592a", "attempt": 1, "context_epoch": 0, "session_id": "sess-1f63af3dea"}, "ts": 1789095578.288324}, {"seq": 105, "kind": "work_item_submitted", "payload": {"item_id": "wi-ed2210e0c8", "submission_id": "submission-919b050bf6", "node_id": "node-d55f84592a", "attempt": 1, "context_epoch": 0, "session_id": "sess-1f63af3dea", "output_sha256": "1ff9dbc5ded0aa5e099805173e75d3067c4c14fc1947c554e514d4670c1c372a", "package_id": "dep-3e4fcc9904"}, "ts": 1789095578.2890015}]}
